  "_about": "THE GUENON (2026-11-21, tools/creaturegen/rework/bigmam/guenon.py, written whole on its own rig in its standing pose): a vervet monkey male, ~0.5 m long, the tail ~0.65 m. SLIM and light on long slender limbs, walking on palms and soles, the back level; a small ROUND head, short muzzle, the BLACK bare face framed by a WHITE BROW BAND and white cheek whiskers swept back, a white chin; olive-grey agouti back, the belly and inner thighs white, hands and feet black; a LONG tail arching up off the rump and hanging behind, black-tipped. Coats: vervet; DE BRAZZA's (grey, an orange-red crescent over the brow, a white beard); the grivet (paler, browner olive).",
